quantrules implements portfolio construction and trading-rule techniques
described in Robert Carver's "Systematic Trading" (Harriman House, 2015) and
on his blog at https://qoppac.blogspot.com. Those works are cited as
references only. All code in this repository was written from first
principles and from publicly published formulas. No code was copied or
adapted from pysystemtrade or any other GPL-licensed project.

